Description: quit when the window is closed
 The main loop only stops on a key press (event type 2, SDL_KEYDOWN), so
 the close button of the window, and SIGTERM/SIGINT (which SDL turns into
 SDL_QUIT), had no effect. Also stop on SDL_QUIT.
